            "review_title": "Review at Kinh Do Hanoi Cafe 252 Hang Bong",
            "review_text": "timmind\nStevens Point, Wisconsin386 contributions\n0\nAwed by the history, but the pho seemed bland\nMar 2020\nWe were brought to eat here by a guide, who told us the fascinating story and ordered for us. We had chicken pho, which was really more like a plain chicken soup, and another beef dish eaten by dipping bread into the thick broth. I now read the reviews and realize that we were not served their best dishes, which are more French than Vietnamese. I wish we could have tasted the desserts which look excellent.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 19, 2020",
